# Frere Jacques, strum along (repertoire plan: frere-jacques).
# Your part: a one-finger G (finger 3 on string 1, fret 3; strum strings 4 to 1), four even
# downstrums in every bar. The teacher sings or plays the tune; the second time it is a round and
# a second voice comes in two bars later. One chord fits the whole round.
title: Frère Jacques (strum along)
id: frere-jacques
composer: Traditional French
source: French round of the 18th century; French words; arranged for Sixstring Academy
arranger: Sixstring Academy
licence: Public domain (traditional); this arrangement is original to Sixstring Academy
difficulty: 1
tags: strumming, first chord, round, lyrics, beginner
tempo: 88
time: 4/4
key: G

